1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,903
Liquids and gases cannot be sheared.

2
00:00:02,903 --> 00:00:08,541
They have no rigidity, so sound in a fluid is always longitudinal.

3
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:15,390
But a solid resists both squeezing and shearing, so it carries longitudinal and transverse waves.

